nal_width/proportional_height\n\n按照预设好的比例 \n选择1:1（2:3等等）+fit（选择填充的格式）+ scale to side +scale to length \n如果scale to side = none  那么按照height的数值作为最长边。\n\n按照总像素数缩放\n选择 scale to side= total pixels（这里已经是1000的倍数）    \nscale to length = 1000    意思是： 1000*1000= 100w像素\n然后根据比例调整到对应的宽和高，如果有空白，按照fit的选择进行填充。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "总结", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [724.3568115234375, 288.2371520996094], "pos": [-536.7142333984375, 1015.6865844726562], "id": 12, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 142], "pos": [1098.5042724609375, 216.58096313476562], "widgets_values": ["1440", "2560"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 14, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [832.4901733398438, 284.4258728027344], "widgets_values": ["1440"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 15, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [834.6712646484375, 418.2708740234375], "widgets_values": ["2560"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 16, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, 